'' RUN: 'dim shared pl as PL = ( @ga, 5 )' -- addresses among data in a shared or static
'' UDT, an array of them, and a procedure pointer between two integers. Neither the
'' pointer-table fold nor the byte-image fold took it, the declaration declined silently,
'' and the global was zero: '*pl.p' faulted. Each address is now a relocation at its
'' offset in the image. Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target win64-msvc tests/codegen/src/global-mixed-init.bas -o tests/codegen/globalmixedinit.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/win64-msvc
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/globalmixedinit.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  11 5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: alpha beta gamma
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: x1 y1
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  7 22 2.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  11 1 22 2
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  22
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  3 42 9
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  22 4
